# Cargo build output
/target/

# `tauri android init` / `tauri ios init` output and the generated ACL schemas.
# The Android Gradle project is regenerated on every CI run and re-patched by
# scripts/patch-android-signing.ts, so nothing under gen/ belongs in git.
/gen/

# By-products of `npm run app:icons`. Only the desktop set beside them is read
# from here (bundle.icon in tauri.conf.json). There is no iOS flavor at all, and
# the Android launcher icons the APK actually ships are the ones the same script
# writes into gen/android/app/src/main/res — a committed copy under icons/ is
# never consulted by `tauri android init`, so keeping one only invites the
# belief that the APK is branded when it is not.
/icons/android/
/icons/ios/

# C-30: signing material never enters the repository.
/gen/android/release.jks
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
